-2.0", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-18T11:37:41Z", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lmnr-ai/index/HEAD/LICENSE"}, "data": null, "document": null, "weights": null}, "links": [{"rel": "primary", "url": "https://github.com/lmnr-ai/index"}], "name": "Index", "notes": "GitHub reports the repository as archived, with the last push on 2025-06-09. The tree holds the agent, Playwright browser and controller modules (actions include give_human_control and spreadsheet-cell clicks), providers for Anthropic, Bedrock, Gemini, Vertex, OpenAI and Groq, and two structured-output eval scripts rather than a benchmark. The README also advertises a hosted serverless Index API and chat UI run by Laminar; their current availability was not checked. Apache-2.0 covers repository code only.", "published_at": null, "relations": [], "review_status": "curated", "scope": "core", "summary": "Archived Laminar browser agent in Python that drives Playwright Chromium with vision-capable LLMs, returns Pydantic-structured results and offers an interactive CLI with optional Laminar tracing.", "topics": ["web-navigation", "observability", "human-in-the-loop", "history"], "updated_at": null, "url": "https://github.com/lmnr-ai/index"}
